>> Combination := Daim-teev tshiab.

Combination thaum-tuaj: ['ntxiv-tom-kawg:'] ua: { :el
	tus-kheej 
	nrhiav: el, Tsis-muaj-dabtsi? tseeb: { tus-kheej ntxiv-tom-kawg: el. }.
}.

>> colours := Combination tshiab.
colours
	ntxiv-tom-kawg: ['red'],
	ntxiv-tom-kawg: ['green'],
	ntxiv-tom-kawg: ['blue'],
	ntxiv-tom-kawg: ['red'].

Tawm sau-ntawv: colours, kab-tshiab.
